morgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32123,31186,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32123, 31186, 4)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-280 and <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> starting up to 8 hp/turn)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Ice Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Ice Missile</span> (50-210)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\"><img alt=\"Paralyze\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slowed_Icon_942885.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Paralyse\">Paralyzing Ice Bomb</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\"><img alt=\"Paralyze\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slowed_Icon_942885.gif\" width=\